# ArduPilot (ArduCopter heli-dual) SITL parameters for ingenuity (NASA Ingenuity coaxial helicopter):
#   sim_vehicle.py -v ArduCopter -f heli-dual --model JSON:<host> --add-param-file=<this file>
# Self-contained: with --model JSON the binary loads no frame defaults (standard_vtol / explora convention), so this file
# carries the two files sim_vehicle would otherwise layer for -f heli-dual (Tools/autotest/pysim/vehicleinfo.json:
# default_params/copter-heli.parm then default_params/copter-heli-dual.parm, ArduPilot b7ba8bca02, 2025-08-09) with the
# vehicle's own values last. Everything not listed is ArduCopter's own default.
#
# Vehicle values (the last block) are the PteroSim SITL set that flew the compiled-in Ingenuity in April 2026
# (scripts/ardupilot/copter-heli-dual-ingenuity.parm): coaxial dual (FRAME_CLASS 11, H_DUAL_MODE 2), yaw by differential
# collective only (H_YAW_SCALER 0, H_DCP_SCALER -0.25), no weathervaning, and rate gains chosen for the model. Not from
# NASA: the real Ingenuity flies its own JPL flight software, not ArduPilot.
#
# Collective: H_COL_ANG_MIN 0 / H_COL_ANG_MAX 15 are the pitch range ArduPilot assumes; Systems/rotor_control.xml maps the
# same command to 0..25 deg of root pitch and puts zero thrust at 12.5 deg (0.75 x blade twist) -- the two disagree, see
# README.md; H_COL_ZERO_THRST 13.2 is that JSBSim number, not a NASA one.
#
# Channel map (channel = SERVOn - 1), the functions heli-dual assigns by default, written out so Controls.xml can cite them:
#   SERVO1..3 = Motor1..3 (33..35)  swashplate 1 (upper rotor)  -> channels 0..2 -> fcs/upper-swash-servo0..2
#   SERVO4..6 = Motor4..6 (36..38)  swashplate 2 (lower rotor)  -> channels 3..5 -> fcs/lower-swash-servo0..2
#   SERVO8    = HeliRSC (31)        rotor speed control         -> channel 7   -> both motors

# ---- ArduPilot default_params/copter-heli.parm (SITL heli defaults; INS offsets make SITL treat the IMU as calibrated)
BATT_MONITOR 4.0000
COMPASS_OFS2_X 5.0000
COMPASS_OFS2_Y 13.0000
COMPASS_OFS2_Z -18.0000
COMPASS_OFS3_X 1.0000
COMPASS_OFS3_Y 1.0000
COMPASS_OFS3_Z 1.0000
COMPASS_OFS_X 2.8749
COMPASS_OFS_Y -21.8262
COMPASS_OFS_Z -21.8422
FLTMODE1 7.0000
FLTMODE2 9.0000
FLTMODE3 6.0000
FLTMODE4 3.0000
FLTMODE5 5.0000
INS_ACCOFFS_X 0.001
INS_ACCOFFS_Y 0.001
INS_ACCOFFS_Z 0.001
INS_ACCSCAL_X 1.001
INS_ACCSCAL_Y 1.001
INS_ACCSCAL_Z 1.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_X 0.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_Y 0.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_Z 0.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_X 1.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_Y 1.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_Z 1.001
INS_ACC3OFFS_X 0.000
INS_ACC3OFFS_Y 0.000
INS_ACC3OFFS_Z 0.000
INS_ACC3SCAL_X 1.000
INS_ACC3SCAL_Y 1.000
INS_ACC3SCAL_Z 1.000
ATC_INPUT_TC 0.20
ATC_ANG_RLL_P 4
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD 0
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTE 20
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT 20
ATC_RAT_PIT_ILMI 0.1
ATC_RAT_PIT_IMAX 0.4
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD 0
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTE 20
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT 20
ATC_RAT_RLL_ILMI 0.1
ATC_RAT_RLL_IMAX 0.4
ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTD 0
ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTE 0
ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTT 20
ATC_RAT_YAW_ILMI 0
ATC_RAT_YAW_IMAX 1
ATC_ACC_P_MAX 600
ATC_ACC_R_MAX 600
ATC_ACC_Y_MAX 600
H_COL_MAX 1740
H_COL_MIN 1460
H_RSC_MODE 2
RC1_MAX 2000.000000
RC1_MIN 1000.000000
RC1_TRIM 1500.000000
RC2_MAX 2000.000000
RC2_MIN 1000.000000
RC2_TRIM 1500.000000
RC3_MAX 2000.000000
RC3_MIN 1000.000000
RC3_TRIM 1500.000000
RC4_MAX 2000.000000
RC4_MIN 1000.000000
RC4_TRIM 1500.000000
RC5_MAX 2000.000000
RC5_MIN 1000.000000
RC5_TRIM 1500.000000
RC6_MAX 2000.000000
RC6_MIN 1000.000000
RC6_TRIM 1500.000000
RC7_MAX 2000.000000
RC7_MIN 1000.000000
RC7_TRIM 1500.000000
RC8_MAX 2000.000000
RC8_MIN 1000.000000
RC8_TRIM 1500.000000
RPM1_TYPE 10
IM_ACRO_COL_EXP 0.2
PSC_NE_VEL_D 0.5
SERVO8_MIN 1000.000000
SERVO8_MAX 2000.000000

# ---- ArduPilot default_params/copter-heli-dual.parm

# ---- explicit servo functions (heli-dual defaults)
SERVO1_FUNCTION 33
SERVO2_FUNCTION 34
SERVO3_FUNCTION 35
SERVO4_FUNCTION 36
SERVO5_FUNCTION 37
SERVO6_FUNCTION 38
SERVO8_FUNCTION 31

# ---- ingenuity (PteroSim, April 2026 SITL set)
FRAME_CLASS 11
H_DUAL_MODE 2
H_COL_ANG_MIN 0
H_COL_ANG_MAX 15
H_COL_ZERO_THRST 13.2
H_COL2_MAX 1740
H_COL2_MIN 1460
H_DCP_SCALER -0.25
H_YAW_SCALER 0
H_CYC_MAX 1000
ATC_RAT_RLL_FF 0.15
ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.06
ATC_RAT_RLL_D 0.005
ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.15
ATC_RAT_PIT_FF 0.15
ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.06
ATC_RAT_PIT_D 0.005
ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.15
ATC_ANG_PIT_P 4.5
ATC_ANG_YAW_P 4.5
ATC_RAT_YAW_D 0.0015
ATC_RAT_YAW_P 0.5
ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM 0
PILOT_Y_RATE_TC 0.08
PILOT_Y_RATE 120
ATC_RAT_YAW_FF 0.1
ATC_RAT_YAW_I 0.1
H_RSC_SETPOINT 70

